  "claim_boundary": "This source-pinned, failure-inclusive development packet measures one generic self-contained-subset-crop family on the immutable second disjoint 20 ARC1 plus 20 ARC2 filename-only development cohort. For each visible input, it enumerates input-color subsets, induces each subset's row/column bounding rectangle, retains only rectangles whose cells are closed under that subset, and returns the uniquely smallest non-full-grid crop. It refuses equal-area crop ties and never carries a learned color identity across examples. P0016 is the same-cohort pre-change baseline; this packet may compare against it but is development evidence only, not blind generalization and not an ARC-AGI-1 or ARC-AGI-2 solver claim. The live controller receives only visible training input/output examples and test inputs. It receives no task ID, imported cohort metadata, GT feature contract, GT solver, historical decomposition, or held-out output before committing a complete grid. P0013 remains an immutable 0/50 frozen negative measurement and is not rerun or rewritten.",
